(6465157, 959139, 108580, '<td valign="top">A fork in the tree, I get it. But will the voters? By bitter experience I doubt this will take honours. Are you doing a DPC experiment? A good representative shot, showing the bird in it''s natural environs, albeit a bit soft. Yes DPC has tainted me into believing everything here should be PP to hell and gone.</td>', 'A fork in the tree, I get it. But will the voters? By bitter experience I doubt this will take honours. Are you doing a DPC experiment? A good representative shot, showing the bird in it''s natural environs, albeit a bit soft. Yes DPC has tainted me into believing everything here should be PP to hell and gone.', '2011-07-08 09:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465165, 960017, 108580, '<td valign="top">Ballsy. Your interpretation will not be appreciated here. I like the rich opposing colours and simple composition though.</td>', 'Ballsy. Your interpretation will not be appreciated here. I like the rich opposing colours and simple composition though.', '2011-07-08 09:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465195, 960115, 108580, '<td valign="top">He''s done it again...simply remarkable. Imagination and photographic skill 2nd to none. Christophe, where''s all the furniture, did you sell it to buy that lens? Some serious HFD DOF going on there!</td>', 'He''s done it again...simply remarkable. Imagination and photographic skill 2nd to none. Christophe, where''s all the furniture, did you sell it to buy that lens? Some serious HFD DOF going on there!', '2011-07-08 10:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465205, 959919, 108580, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean and edible, the way DPC''ers like it ;)</td>', 'Crisp, clean and edible, the way DPC''ers like it ;)', '2011-07-08 10:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465216, 959210, 108580, '<td valign="top">Yup the cute vote :) Very creative. Peanut butter on the fork? Has he got a social security number yet? What about employee benefits? Keep ''em coming, squirrel and all.</td>', 'Yup the cute vote :) Very creative. Peanut butter on the fork? Has he got a social security number yet? What about employee benefits? Keep ''em coming, squirrel and all.', '2011-07-08 10:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
