(6465385, 959216, 125275, '<td valign="top">Creepy! I like it.</td>', 'Creepy! I like it.', '2011-07-08 12:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465816, 960115, 59796, '<td valign="top">Phew! What can I say? Yet another Blue to you :) Amazing idea and execution. With the exception of the reflections on the 2 knives to the left, everything''s perfect! <br/>And that floating tie! You do take care of the details don''t you? :)</td>', 'Phew! What can I say? Yet another Blue to you :) Amazing idea and execution. With the exception of the reflections on the 2 knives to the left, everything''s perfect! And that floating tie! You do take care of the details don''t you? :)', '2011-07-08 20:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465827, 960162, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very very creative picture and title. Even the positioning of the hands is perfect! I hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Very very creative picture and title. Even the positioning of the hands is perfect! I hope this ribbons.', '2011-07-08 20:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465834, 960016, 59796, '<td valign="top">Ha! Could fit the "Six word memoirs" as well!<br/>Very nice imagination and wonderful execution. Maybe you should try this on 1x.com as well (after you clean up a bit of the grey splotches behind the sheriff''s head)<br/>I hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Ha! Could fit the "Six word memoirs" as well!Very nice imagination and wonderful execution. Maybe you should try this on 1x.com as well (after you clean up a bit of the grey splotches behind the sheriff''s head)I hope this ribbons.', '2011-07-08 20:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465839, 960168, 59796, '<td valign="top">Neat! The low-key lighting and the off-center composition work very well together. Any more zooming out, and the white reflections on the left would''ve started dominating the picture. Nicely done. My top5.</td>', 'Neat! The low-key lighting and the off-center composition work very well together. Any more zooming out, and the white reflections on the left would''ve started dominating the picture. Nicely done. My top5.', '2011-07-08 20:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465843, 959538, 59796, '<td valign="top">But for the double reflection, this is a perfect capture. I would''ve avoided glass for reflection. Nicely done though. Top10 for sure.</td>', 'But for the double reflection, this is a perfect capture. I would''ve avoided glass for reflection. Nicely done though. Top10 for sure.', '2011-07-08 20:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465845, 959919, 59796, '<td valign="top">The good old honey cascade :)<br/>I can imagine the amount of work needed to setup and cleanup - although I''ve never done it myself. This is done well. My top 10.</td>', 'The good old honey cascade :)I can imagine the amount of work needed to setup and cleanup - although I''ve never done it myself. This is done well. My top 10.', '2011-07-08 20:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465849, 959210, 59796, '<td valign="top">I think you hit upon the right idea!! Train a cute squirrel to do what you want for 6 months, then use the squirrel to ace the challenges for the next 6 months! lol. I can''t honestly imagine how you do so well with squirrels. This one''s too cute - cuter than the Absolut challenge. And the title!! Perfect!</td>', 'I think you hit upon the right idea!! Train a cute squirrel to do what you want for 6 months, then use the squirrel to ace the challenges for the next 6 months! lol. I can''t honestly imagine how you do so well with squirrels. This one''s too cute - cuter than the Absolut challenge. And the title!! Perfect!', '2011-07-08 21:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465852, 960088, 59796, '<td valign="top">Ouch! I''ll stick to my dessert then. :P<br/>The title and the picture work very well together to induce the cringe. My top5.</td>', 'Ouch! I''ll stick to my dessert then. :PThe title and the picture work very well together to induce the cringe. My top5.', '2011-07-08 21:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465883, 960011, 18778, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool way to articulate such a known food ideology.  Not in love with the PP style as I think particularly with the reflection as your primary subject- a clean finish would have really taken this home for me.  Great creativity.</td>', 'This is a very cool way to articulate such a known food ideology.  Not in love with the PP style as I think particularly with the reflection as your primary subject- a clean finish would have really taken this home for me.  Great creativity.', '2011-07-08 21:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465889, 959210, 18778, '<td valign="top">This is a personal thing, &amp; maybe it''s because of where I''m from... but all the squirrels make me feel...*blech*<br/>On to the photo- I like the choice in depth of field here.  The sharpened fur of the arms and face are a nice contrast to the tail.</td>', 'This is a personal thing, & maybe it''s because of where I''m from... but all the squirrels make me feel...*blech*On to the photo- I like the choice in depth of field here.  The sharpened fur of the arms and face are a nice contrast to the tail.', '2011-07-08 21:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465891, 960145, 18778, '<td valign="top">I''m in love with this image!  Great concept.  I also dig your choice of crop here.  Very modern.</td>', 'I''m in love with this image!  Great concept.  I also dig your choice of crop here.  Very modern.', '2011-07-08 21:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465897, 959947, 18778, '<td valign="top">Thank Gawd for the title- on image alone, I find this image confusing at best.  The choice of lighting is so abrupt, it leaves the windows floating. At first glance- I was trying to make the silver ''be the shadow'' of the crucifix but I don''t think that''s what you were going for?</td>', 'Thank Gawd for the title- on image alone, I find this image confusing at best.  The choice of lighting is so abrupt, it leaves the windows floating. At first glance- I was trying to make the silver ''be the shadow'' of the crucifix but I don''t think that''s what you were going for?', '2011-07-08 22:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465899, 960148, 18778, '<td valign="top">With the reflection of the blade being such a dominant part of the image- it would be cool to have seen where you could have gone with those possibilities.</td>', 'With the reflection of the blade being such a dominant part of the image- it would be cool to have seen where you could have gone with those possibilities.', '2011-07-08 22:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465901, 959881, 18778, '<td valign="top">Beautiful captured.  I love the tone of this image.  It looks like a brutal southern lady''s summer fan!</td>', 'Beautiful captured.  I love the tone of this image.  It looks like a brutal southern lady''s summer fan!', '2011-07-08 22:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
