(6465937, 960097, 18778, '<td valign="top">A+ on the creative concept here.  The reflection of the silver is also a nice choice and I appreciate the choice in crop- specifically, to show more of the reflection than of the actual subject.  Howeves- that border is killin'' me!  It''s very distracting on an otherwise very clear, crisp image.</td>', 'A+ on the creative concept here.  The reflection of the silver is also a nice choice and I appreciate the choice in crop- specifically, to show more of the reflection than of the actual subject.  Howeves- that border is killin'' me!  It''s very distracting on an otherwise very clear, crisp image.', '2011-07-08 23:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465941, 960134, 18778, '<td valign="top">I dig the perspective here.  Eye level is an interesting choice.</td>', 'I dig the perspective here.  Eye level is an interesting choice.', '2011-07-08 23:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465958, 960119, 18778, '<td valign="top">This shot feels very scattered.  The place mats- $13 dollars- is that a ziplock?  I''m a fan of photojournalism, but this just feels like awkward prop choice &amp; placement.  I mean, if you wanna have bugger sugar as your subject- let''s get creative with it!</td>', 'This shot feels very scattered.  The place mats- $13 dollars- is that a ziplock?  I''m a fan of photojournalism, but this just feels like awkward prop choice & placement.  I mean, if you wanna have bugger sugar as your subject- let''s get creative with it!', '2011-07-08 23:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
