(6466511, 960168, 58634, '<td valign="top">I really like the POV of this image. At first, I wasn''t grasping the concept as much and then I saw your title and thought to myself "ahh, that''s pretty cool." Good job.</td>', 'I really like the POV of this image. At first, I wasn''t grasping the concept as much and then I saw your title and thought to myself "ahh, that''s pretty cool." Good job.', '2011-07-09 19:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
