(6466513, 959919, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very much like one of the winners of the Honey challenge. Nice, crisp and excellent.</td>', 'Very much like one of the winners of the Honey challenge. Nice, crisp and excellent.', '2011-07-09 19:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
