(6466515, 959538, 58634, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a delicate image. I like the fact that the forks are new and don''t have scratch marks on them, it makes it look very crisp. I also enjoy the reflections a lot. Definitely a ribbon contender.</td>', 'This is definitely a delicate image. I like the fact that the forks are new and don''t have scratch marks on them, it makes it look very crisp. I also enjoy the reflections a lot. Definitely a ribbon contender.', '2011-07-09 19:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
