(6467814, 960119, 66709, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ndistress:</b></div><hr/><i> This shot feels very scattered.  The place mats- $13 dollars- is that a ziplock?  I''m a fan of photojournalism, but this just feels like awkward prop choice &amp; placement.  I mean, if you wanna have bugger sugar as your subject- let''s get creative with it! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have no ideas about your comment!!!!!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by ndistress: This shot feels very scattered.  The place mats- $13 dollars- is that a ziplock?  I''m a fan of photojournalism, but this just feels like awkward prop choice & placement.  I mean, if you wanna have bugger sugar as your subject- let''s get creative with it!   I have no ideas about your comment!!!!!!!', '2011-07-11 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
